[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:25. Mrs. Smith's Kitchen]
[00:00.620]Lesson 25 | 第25课
[00:02.800]Mrs Smith's kitchen is small. | 史密斯太太的厨房很小。
[00:06.655]There is a refrigerator in the kitchen. | 厨房里有一台冰箱。
[00:10.510]The refrigerator is white. | 冰箱是白色的。
[00:13.875]It is on the right. | 它在右边。
[00:16.815]There is an electric cooker in the kitchen. | 厨房里有一个电饭煲。
[00:20.835]The cooker is blue. | 电饭煲是蓝色的。
[00:23.535]It is on the left. | 它在左边。
[00:26.460]There is a table in the middle of the room. | 房间中央有一张桌子。
[00:30.785]There is a bottle on the table. | 桌子上有一个瓶子。
[00:34.060]The bottle is empty. | 瓶子是空的。
[00:37.050]There is a cup on the table too. | 桌子上还有一个杯子。
[00:40.455]The cup is clean. | 杯子很干净。